A toc marker that places nothing renders the kind floor

```
::: toc "Contents"
:::
.
<div class="toc">
  <p class="admonition-title">Contents</p>
</div>
```

```
::: toc "Contents" [Overview]
Authored.
:::
.
<div class="toc">
  <p class="admonition-title">Contents</p>
  <p class="div-label">Overview</p>
  <p>Authored.</p>
</div>
```
